  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/reyamira/pass-cli/zipball/v0.20.0",
  "body": "## Pass-CLI 0.20.0\n\nA secure, cross-platform CLI password and API key manager for developers.\n\n### Installation\n\n#### Homebrew (macOS/Linux)\n```bash\nbrew install reyamira/tap/pass-cli\n```\n\n#### Scoop (Windows)\n```powershell\nscoop bucket add reyamira https://github.com/reyamira/scoop-bucket\nscoop install pass-cli\n```\n\n#### Manual Installation\nDownload the appropriate archive for your platform below, extract it, and add the binary to your PATH.\n\n## Changelog\n### Features\n* 01c7fc2e42c5c3b3d04ced7e467178f70ae079b9: feat(skills): ship version-matched agent guides via `pass-cli skills` (#148) (@arimxyer)\n### Bug Fixes\n* 5260d141f1fcd2b7716122e3cc47032f9cd70cf1: fix(docs): repair broken links breaking the Pages deploy (#145) (@arimxyer)\n### Others\n* f42ade35716d6faa4ebeea1c426a307d386a2b77: chore(release): cut v0.20.0 (#150) (@arimxyer)\n* a63f05b813e4c6d82a7f3289bae3d07abdcd8850: docs(release): correct the release process — no update-docs-version workflow (#146) (@arimxyer)\n\n### Verification\n\nAll binaries are checksummed and can be verified:\n```bash\nsha256sum -c checksums.txt\n```\n\n### Full Changelog\nSee the full changelog at https://github.com/reyamira/pass-cli/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n\n",
